.TH OYAMA-HRT-APP 1 "2026-11-01" "Oyama's HRT Tracker 0.5.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
oyama-hrt-app \- desktop application for tracking hormone replacement therapy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B oyama-hrt-app
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B oyama-hrt-app
is a native Qt 6 desktop application for tracking hormone replacement therapy
doses, lab results, and pharmacokinetic curves. All data is stored locally in
an encrypted PostgreSQL database managed by the application.
.PP
The application provides a graphical interface for:
.IP \(bu 2
Recording and editing dose events (injections, patches, gels, oral, etc.)
.IP \(bu 2
Viewing pharmacokinetic curves (E2, CPA, T) over time
.IP \(bu 2
Importing and exporting encrypted backups
.IP \(bu 2
Managing settings, preferences, and calibration data
.PP
On first run, the application guides the user through vault setup, including
recovery phrase generation and PostgreSQL cluster initialization.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/oyama-hrt/
Application configuration and UI preferences.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/oyama-hrt/
Application data directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR oyama-hrt-cli (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Oyama's HRT Tracker contributors.
